# routine — learn a Gather routine, then stay some days at the source
#
# A successful gather teaches a Gather routine for the source, the area and the hour. Walking it opens
# the gathering phase, which exists only for routines: a slider of days, a forecast, and on STAY the
# clock moves on and every attempt the stay offered is rolled — a success takes the item, a failure
# spoils it, and either way the slot has to regrow (GatherYield).
#
# The ford in Test Field holds a natural item: gathered once here by hand, then depleted for 90 days.
# A 100-day stay therefore reaches it again — the regrowth is what this asserts, since the slot taken
# by hand is the only one the stay could otherwise have had. `strategy succeed` forces every roll.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Field" --period dawn --observe-only "Test Ford"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal gather
advance 12 180
click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect-verb gather
expect Item received:

# Learned on the spot, and not a Go to: the visit is left from where it opened.
inspect routines
expect-state routines category=gather location=
expect-state routines Test Ford
expect-state routines Test Field
expect-state routines time=Dawn

# Two presses: the first closes the segment the gather left pending (CONTINUE) and opens the next
# phase, whose preview is drained before the footer becomes LEAVE.
observe none
click button
wait 60
advance 12 180
click button
wait mode WorldView 90
expect-no-state routines category=goto
save roundtrip

travel neighbour
travel-go
wait mode LocationInteraction 120
advance 12 180
click button
wait mode WorldView 90

travel back
routines
routines gather
wait mode Gathering 150

inspect gather
expect-state gather phase=configure
expect-state gather Test Ford

gather days 100
inspect gather
expect-state gather days=100
expect-no-state gather attempts=0
gather start
inspect gather
expect-state gather phase=done days=100
expect-no-state gather gathered=0
expect-state gather spoiled=0

gather continue
wait mode WorldView 90

# The routines menu: the kind's slots above the map, the routine in full below it.
inspect routine-slots
expect-state routine-slots category=gather used=1
expect-state routine-slots category=buy used=0
manage Routines gather
wait 10
expect G A T H E R
expect ☐ Gather
expect from Test Ford
expect needs no implement
expect × ·····
quit
